# What `git archive` leaves out of the release tarball. The tarball is what someone
# needs to build PAPvault and run it, and nothing else: the build script, the source
# it inlines, the vendored library, the manual it renders, and the licence.
#
# Everything named here stays in the repository, where anyone who clones can read it.
# It is left out of the tarball because it is how PAPvault was built rather than what
# it is built from.
.claude/           export-ignore
.github/           export-ignore
dev/               export-ignore
.gitattributes     export-ignore
.gitignore         export-ignore
CLAUDE.md          export-ignore
